{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼先落在上方左侧两行大号白色标题，随后容易被下方同样醒目的大号文字及紫色强调词吸引。上下两块都很显眼，主视线不够集中。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人在一段让自己感到幸福的关系中，担心眼前的美好不能一直持续，想得到对方不会改变的保证。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、害怕失去、缺乏安全感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"更具体的处境是：起初怕自己的需要成为对方的负担，如今更怕对方不再需要自己；虽然想少表达心意来减少受伤，却发现真心藏起来反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方标题和下方大号文字两块都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在标题和下方文字中，需要拼接才能理解完整的处境与感受。\",\n    \"下方单块文字较长，包含害怕成为负担、害怕不被需要、想隐藏心意、隐藏后更难受等多层意思。\",\n    \"紫色放大的问句能传达情感矛盾，但单独看不能直接说明具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9bcc83cd-de39-4b22-b5e3-60299e1c8554", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022443421847Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:25:13.015807+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9a39e054b784834726d8c0d5d76c8253c7eaa07f6a2ffd0a9efd1996740a2708", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae